{"repositoryId":1338836965,"availability":"available","full":"Meykiio/dz-green","name":"dz-green","description":"A community-run live map of Algeria's tree planting, tree care, and wildfire reports — every tree on one map, so the next person plants one too.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":29,"forks":5,"created":"2026-08-18T21:04:07Z","updated":"2026-09-28T15:32:05Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://green-dz.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://green-dz.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:27.137Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:27.137Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:27.137Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:27.137Z","stars":29,"forks":5}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["الجزائر الخضراء خريطة حيّة يصنعها المجتمع: غرست شجرة؟ ضعها على الخريطة. سقيتها؟ سجّلها. رأيت حريقًا؟ أبلغ عنه — ويصلك تنبيه إن اشتعل حريق في ولايتك. مجانًا، بلا حساب، بلا إعلانات — من المجتمع، للمجتمع. green-dz.vercel.app","▶ Use the app — green-dz.vercel.app · Arabic-first interface, English one tap away · free, no account, no ads","Algeria plants trees everywhere — and the proof disappears into social media feeds. Nobody sees the total grow, nobody knows which trees are still watered a month later, and when a fire starts, there's no shared place to see it."],"features":["🌱 Plant a tree — photo + location (GPS, a pin on the map, a Google Maps link, or just your wilaya). A volunteer moderator in your wilaya reviews it before it appears.","💧 Log care — \"I watered it\" / \"I checked it\" on any approved site. Builds a visible timeline, and the map shows which trees are thirsty.","🔥 Report a fire — publishes instantly (speed beats moderation), with the Protection Civile reminder always visible.","🛰️ Fires by satellite — NASA's fire detections appear on the map as amber rings, several times a day, even where nobody is there to report. Tap one for its strength, confidence, and the live weather + smoke at that…","🔔 Fire alerts on your phone — install the app to your home screen, enable alerts for your wilaya (or all of Algeria), and your phone buzzes when a fire is reported. No account, no phone number, and turning it off…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Meykiio/dz-green/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"098f9f0d7939b2794853bc04dc59bb13dbc64633f104589a9aafe0130b854ff9","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:27.233Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:27.233Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"الجزائر الخضراء خريطة حيّة يصنعها المجتمع: غرست شجرة؟ ضعها على الخريطة. سقيتها؟ سجّلها. رأيت حريقًا؟ أبلغ عنه — ويصلك تنبيه إن اشتعل حريق في ولايتك. مجانًا، بلا حساب، بلا إعلانات — من المجتمع، للمجتمع. green-dz.vercel.app","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Meykiio/dz-green/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"▶ Use the app — green-dz.vercel.app · Arabic-first interface, English one tap away · free, no account, no ads","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Meykiio/dz-green/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You don't need an account, and it takes under a minute.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Meykiio/dz-green/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"098f9f0d7939b2794853bc04dc59bb13dbc64633f104589a9aafe0130b854ff9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Meykiio/dz-green/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:27.234Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-28T15:32:05Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Meykiio/dz-green/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:27.235Z","hash":"098f9f0d7939b2794853bc04dc59bb13dbc64633f104589a9aafe0130b854ff9","originalBytes":6965,"storedBytes":6965,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","every","what","fire","one","map","wilaya","algeria","app","when","account","admin","architecture.html","bun","phone","rls","run","supabase","there","trees","volunteers","a